3900	4004	3883	3883	she	229	" Then there 's plenty of time ; we need n't be down before seven . You get on with your dressing ; there 's no use in my getting up till you are done -- we'd be tumbling over each other . This is no room to put two girls to sleep in -- one glass not much bigger than your hand . You 'll have to get your box under your bed .... In my last place I had a beautiful room with a Brussels carpet , and a marble washstand . I would n't stay here three days if it weren't---- "
