4072	4164	4055	4055	Margaret	229	" There 's only one thing to be said for Woodview , and that is the eating ; we have anything we want , and we 'd have more than we want if it were n't for the old cook : she must have her little bit out of everything and she cuts us short in our bacon in the morning . But that reminds me ! You have set the cook against you ; you 'll have to bring her over to your side if you want to remain here . "
